<section id="about" class="relative py-24 max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6 border-t border-white/5">
  <div class="space-y-4 mb-16">
    <span class="font-sans text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-[#d4ded7]/50 block">About Me</span>
    <h2 class="font-display text-4xl sm:text-5xl text-[#ede8e1] tracking-tight font-normal">
      Designing with empathy. <span class="italic text-[#d4ded7]">Engineering with rigor.</span>
    </h2>
  </div>

  <div class="space-y-12">
    <!-- Story Cards -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-8">
      <div class="editorial-panel p-8 sm:p-10 rounded-sm border border-white/10 space-y-4">
        <h3 class="font-display text-2xl text-[#ede8e1] font-normal pb-2 border-b border-white/10">The Journey</h3>
        <p class="font-editorial text-lg text-[#d4ded7]/80 leading-relaxed">
          I taught myself how to code when I was 10 years old and have been building software ever since. From the very beginning, I was just as drawn to the aesthetics and craft of what I built as I was to how it functioned—a conviction that software should feel as thoughtful and refined as it is powerful.
        </p>
        <p class="font-editorial text-lg text-[#d4ded7]/80 leading-relaxed">
          As a <strong>Design Engineer</strong> who graduated from the <strong>Georgia Institute of Technology</strong> in <strong>May 2025</strong> with a B.S. in <strong>Computational Media</strong> (threads in <strong>People &amp; Interaction Design</strong>), I bridge theoretical computer science and human-centered design. True interaction design must deeply understand the hardware, network latency, and system architecture that powers it.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="editorial-panel p-8 sm:p-10 rounded-sm border border-white/10 space-y-4">
        <div class="flex items-baseline justify-between pb-2 border-b border-white/10">
          <h3 class="font-display text-2xl text-[#ede8e1] font-normal">Munio for Law Enforcement</h3>
          <a 
            href="https://MunioID.com" 
            target="_blank" 
            rel="noopener noreferrer" 
            class="font-sans text-[11px] uppercase tracking-wider text-[#618c77] hover:underline"
          >
            MunioID.com &nearr;
          </a>
        </div>
        <p class="font-editorial text-lg text-[#d4ded7]/80 leading-relaxed">
          In 2023, I co-founded <a href="https://MunioID.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-white underline decoration-white/30 hover:decoration-[#618c77]">Munio (Secure Verification Group)</a>, serving as <strong>Chief Experience Officer (CXO)</strong>. Munio was the <strong>first mDL reader used by an active law enforcement agency in the State of Georgia</strong> and has been field-tested across <strong>5 public safety agencies</strong>.
        </p>
        <p class="font-editorial text-lg text-[#d4ded7]/80 leading-relaxed">
          I designed the rapid tap-to-verify reader flows and mobile client apps in SwiftUI and Compose Multiplatform. To solve real patrol friction, we engineered the <strong>Munio Bridge</strong> desktop companion app—allowing officers to securely transmit verified ID payloads from their phone directly into their vehicle's MDT, utilizing keyboard autofill to populate CAD fields without manual typing. The platform also provides cryptographic accountability and tamper-proof logging to protect both officers and citizens.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Competencies Grid -->
    <div class="editorial-panel p-8 sm:p-10 rounded-sm border border-white/10 space-y-8">
      <h3 class="font-display text-2xl text-[#ede8e1] font-normal pb-2 border-b border-white/10">Core Disciplines</h3>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-8">
        <div class="space-y-4">
          <h4 class="font-sans text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-[#618c77] font-semibold">Interaction &amp; Product Design</h4>
          <ul class="font-editorial text-base text-[#d4ded7]/80 space-y-2">
            <li class="flex items-center gap-2">&bull; Figma Advanced Components &amp; Auto-Layout</li>
            <li class="flex items-center gap-2">&bull; Design Systems &amp; Systematic Tokens</li>
            <li class="flex items-center gap-2">&bull; Qualitative Field Research &amp; User Testing</li>
            <li class="flex items-center gap-2">&bull; Micro-interactions &amp; Ergonomics</li>
            <li class="flex items-center gap-2">&bull; WCAG 2.2 AA Accessibility Standards</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="space-y-4">
          <h4 class="font-sans text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-[#618c77] font-semibold">Software &amp; Creative Engineering</h4>
          <ul class="font-editorial text-base text-[#d4ded7]/80 space-y-2">
            <li class="flex items-center gap-2">&bull; Swift, SwiftUI &amp; Apple CoreNFC</li>
            <li class="flex items-center gap-2">&bull; Kotlin &amp; Compose Multiplatform</li>
            <li class="flex items-center gap-2">&bull; TypeScript, Modern CSS &amp; Tailwind</li>
            <li class="flex items-center gap-2">&bull; Astro, React, Ionic Framework</li>
            <li class="flex items-center gap-2">&bull; ISO 18013-5 mDL Cryptographic Handshakes</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
